      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, it points towards tension-type headaches with possible medication overuse i want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for headache short breaks from the screen every hour and some neck stretches if you get a sudden severe headache or weakness, that's the point to come in urgently"
